# Chatbot Context Cache Directory
# 
# This directory stores conversation context for active chat sessions.
# 
# File format: JSON
# Naming: {session_id}.json
# 
# Each file contains:
# - Conversation history
# - Current intent
# - Extracted entities
# - User context (logged in status, subscription level)
# 
# Cache TTL: 30 minutes of inactivity
# Cleanup: Automatic via Celery task
# 
# DO NOT manually modify files in this directory.
